        "description": "**On Point** is a retro shooter, filled with Warioware-style arcade minigames. Think, aim, and blast your way to a high score through endless shooting minigames, but don't hit those bombs or you'll run out of lives!\n\n## CHRISTMAS IS HERE\n![{\"height\":1440,\"type\":\"image\",\"width\":2560}](https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/227837669_1528295194519461_4575043082141626680_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsv3uJNigqAQ7kNvgGXOlg1&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AYB26E9L0jdVPxF4I1nOJCGnVldfbzLwPux_iJgcYLY4dA&oe=678CCE9C)\n- Christmas has come to On Point!\n- New Xmas Themed Minigames!\n\n## ABOUT\n- Compete in over 90 minigames.\n- Easy, medium, and hard mode.\n- Local, global, and friends leaderboards.\n- Tuned for all experience and comfort levels.\n\n## DESCRIPTION\n- Arcade-style target shooting minigames.\n- Hardcore mode, for experienced players to challenge themselves and the leaderboards.\n- Newcomer mode, low intensity to ease in new players.\n- Relive that retro arcade light-gun experience, in VR!\n",
